this time is, does this even matter to the very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:16.620
same Republican voters who say abortion is&nbsp;
the most important issue to them? Background&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:23.520
