No exceptions for abortion. Nothing, nothing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.600
nothing. Always against it because it's murder.&nbsp;
But he urged me to get and paid for an abortion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.780
